{"id":3929470,"shortDescription":"Warhounds es un juego táctico por turnos sobre un escuadrón de mercenarios de élite con aire de película de acción clásica, inspirado en XCOM y Jagged Alliance. Recluta luchadores únicos, mejora tu base y lucha por el futuro de África. Menos RNG falso, más balística real y táctica letal.","developers":["The First Studios"],"publishers":["Brightika, Inc."],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Compatible con DualSense","Guardar en cualquier momento","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"11 AGO 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/d08c02142ccf792123c8618ce476d5490eca9d4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795188246","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/f6d364c996192a6d4e5d6ac67e0bd04e00e96ba7/ss_f6d364c996192a6d4e5d6ac67e0bd04e00e96ba7.600x338.jpg?t=1795188246","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/f6d364c996192a6d4e5d6ac67e0bd04e00e96ba7/ss_f6d364c996192a6d4e5d6ac67e0bd04e00e96ba7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795188246"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/cbd6aa057581ede0e50ac2e7e41f833d4f505523/ss_cbd6aa057581ede0e50ac2e7e41f833d4f505523.600x338.jpg?t=1795188246","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/cbd6aa057581ede0e50ac2e7e41f833d4f505523/ss_cbd6aa057581ede0e50ac2e7e41f833d4f505523.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795188246"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/99b0badb9acdea0a5395fb61614868ff4e579bba/ss_99b0badb9acdea0a5395fb61614868ff4e579bba.600x338.jpg?t=1795188246","full":"https